Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:18.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,《黑镜》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.23,0:01:33.94,Title,0,0,0,0,,《黑函之舞》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:45.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（重启中）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.89,0:04:05.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（免费下载）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.14,0:04:06.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（下载中）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.35,0:04:10.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（正在诊断 清理并删除恶意软件）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.10,0:07:45.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我们看到你干了什么）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.95,0:08:45.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（回复你的电话号码 不然我们就把这个视频 发给你所有的联系人）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.28,0:09:14.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（您的邮件已发送）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.62,0:09:26.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一条未知信息）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.80,0:09:32.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（保持定位服务开启状态）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.63,0:09:33.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（保持开机并充好电）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.63,0:09:34.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（等时机成熟 你会被启用）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.64,0:09:42.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你是谁）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.14,0:09:48.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你想要钱吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.94,0:09:54.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（不要告诉任何人）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.86,0:09:56.65,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我们在监视着你）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.89,0:11:45.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一条未知信息）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.01,0:11:50.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你已经被启用）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.10,0:11:51.77,Note,0,0,0,0,,（服从指示 不然我们就泄露视频）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.06,0:11:57.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（到这里去 中午12点）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.15,0:12:00.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（工业区 黑石街）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.74,0:12:07.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我在上班）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.45,0:12:13.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（45分钟之内到 不然我们就泄露视频）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.76,0:13:10.14,Note,0,0,0,0,,（还有六公里 到达）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.61,0:13:23.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（不要迟到 你还有90秒）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.80,0:13:44.88,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我到了）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.84,0:13:50.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（等着）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.33,0:15:41.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（确认收到包裹 核实包裹上的数字）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.79,0:15:43.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（把包裹送到这里 121房）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.00,0:18:31.88,Note,0,0,0,0,,（他不开门）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.50,0:18:36.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（说是明迪让你来的）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.70,0:21:07.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我现在可以走了吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.08,0:21:20.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（拍张他的照片）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.00,0:22:41.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（和他一起走 带上包裹）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.42,0:29:46.01,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我们看见你们的定位了）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.72,0:29:51.26,Note,0,0,0,0,,（钥匙在后车轮的上面）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.44,0:29:58.77,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你们走错路了）
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.70,0:30:10.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（调头）
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.52,0:30:38.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（调头）
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.89,0:30:55.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（不然我们就公开一切）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.96,0:33:57.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（国家联合银行）
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.70,0:41:15.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（把钱拿到指定地点）
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.16,0:41:17.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一个人去）
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.08,0:46:54.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（现在 打架）
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.37,0:46:57.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（用死判定输赢）
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.10,0:49:27.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（CEO深陷“种族歧视电子邮件”丑闻）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.24,0:01:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯尼 四号桌有东西洒出来了 去处理下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kenny? Big spillage on table four. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.76,0:01:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.88,0:02:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.24,0:02:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人忘拿东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone forgot this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.72,0:02:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你应该说什么 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you say? - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.44,0:02:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不客气 - 她总是忘东西 再次感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's all right. - She forgets everything. Thanks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.28,0:02:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个瑜伽老师 身体相当柔软 看 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was some yoga teacher, proper bendy. Look. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.44,0:02:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 该死的 怎么 她把这个发送给你了 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus! Fuck! What, she sent that to you, did she?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,真淘气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double naughty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.68,0:02:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,起开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jog on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.60,0:03:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,林兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Linds!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.33,0:03:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,林兹 我的手提电脑在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Linds, where's my laptop?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.84,0:03:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别这么扫兴 - 用你自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't be a bell end! - Use your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.12,0:03:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的坏了 反正你的也卡死了 - 你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mine's bust. Yours has gone all frozen anyway. - What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.64,0:03:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只是想装这个看电影的东东 - 什么看电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was trying to put on this film thing.- What film thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.80,0:03:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 一个可以让你免费看电影的软件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know. Some programme lets you watch free films.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.80,0:03:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我装上去的时候 它就卡死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}While I was trying to put it on, then it locked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.52,0:03:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 诶 这不是我的错 - 不要再拿走它了 又不是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, it's not my fault. - Don't take it again. It's not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.56,0:03:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 你弄好了修一下我的吧 - “你弄好了修一下我的吧”\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, fix mine when you've done that. - "Fix mine when you've done that."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.18,0:04:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要刮花我的钢板 - 管它呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop nicking my Cokes! - Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.46,0:04:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你画的吗 肯尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you draw that yourself, Kenny?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.58,0:04:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯尼 谢谢 明天见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Kenny. See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.80,0:04:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.10,0:04:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜 肯尼 - 拜 肯尼 明天见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye, Kenny. - Bye, Kenny, I'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.34,0:05:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're mental.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.50,0:05:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你疯了 - 你是个小偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're mental. - You're a thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.86,0:05:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 肯尼 你觉得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love? Kenny? What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.34,0:05:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我还是有点不习惯这个颜色 - 挺不错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm still not used to the colour. - It's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.70,0:05:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.82,0:05:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以帮我个忙 好好看着你妹妹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do me a favour and prison-guard your sister, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.14,0:05:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会太晚回来的 应该吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't be late. Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.46,0:05:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊 他已经在门口了 冰箱里有千层面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! He's outside.There's a lasagna thing in the freezer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.70,0:05:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.62,0:10:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到我的钥匙了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen my keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.22,0:10:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧 肯 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay, Ken? Love?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.74,0:10:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.30,0:11:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早上好 肯尼 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morning, Kenny. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.48,0:12:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 肯尼 - 我觉得很难受\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kenny? - Feeling really sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.08,0:12:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你才来而已 - 我知道 可是我觉得我要吐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've only just got here. - I know but think I might throw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.48,0:12:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 下一次你能不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, just next time can you…?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.40,0:12:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 莫激动啊 蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Easy, knobber.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.50,0:14:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.62,0:14:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是易碎物品 - 这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's fragile. - What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.54,0:14:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们让我这么干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told me to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.49,0:15:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样吗 我现在该做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it? What do I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.57,0:15:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的帮不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't really help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.17,0:15:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要做些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I have to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.85,0:15:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他们说什么 你只要干了 就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just whatever they say and once you've done that, you're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.09,0:15:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们放过你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They let you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.89,0:17:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁阿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.77,0:17:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快递\N{\fnArial\fs30}Del… Delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.33,0:17:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,送错房间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.73,0:17:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说121房\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said 121.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.77,0:17:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 这里没有定快递\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there's no delivery here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.13,0:17:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可是他们说 - 我什么都没有定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But they said… - I haven't ordered anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.93,0:18:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个蛋糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.53,0:18:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么蛋糕 - 不知道 我猜是个海绵蛋糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What cake? - I don't know. I think it's a sponge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.53,0:18:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有订蛋糕 你把它送回蛋糕店\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't order a cake so just take it back to the bakery.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.93,0:18:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告诉他们弄错了 - 嗨 如果我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and tell them they got it wrong. - Look, if I…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.97,0:18:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想要蛋糕 你再不走我就叫前台了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want the cake.So go away or I call the front desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.81,0:18:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把蛋糕踢进你的屁股里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will kick that cake up your fucking arse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.17,0:18:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,明迪让我来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}M-Mindy sent me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.57,0:19:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么 明迪在哪 - 他们只是叫我把这个送给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is this? Where's Mindy? - I was just told to give this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.61,0:19:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明迪告诉你的吗 - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mindy told you? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.49,0:19:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你刚刚说“明迪” - 是他们叫我这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You said "Mindy." - That's what they told me to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.97,0:19:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.77,0:19:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你说什么 你说明迪定了个蛋糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are you saying?Are you saying Mindy ordered the cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.53,0:19:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 呃 我不知道 是 他们 是他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, uh, I don't know.It… they… it was them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.89,0:19:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们 他们 你到底是干嘛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Them? They? Who the fuck are you on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.41,0:19:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那些人 - 他妈的哪些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The people. - What fucking people?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.69,0:19:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,手机里的人 电话里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The phone people.The people on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.93,0:19:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们让我带蛋糕来 他们给我发信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told me to bring the cake, and they're leaving texts on my phone,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.37,0:19:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后我就按照他们说的做了 - 喂 喂 慢点说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and then I do what they say. - Whoa, whoa. Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.05,0:19:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,用鼻子呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just breathe through your nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.81,0:19:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,用鼻子 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through your nose. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.53,0:19:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 现在 让我看看他们说了什么 给我你手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Now, just show me what they said. On your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.09,0:19:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我看信息 - 好的 嗯 嗯 这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Show me the text. - Okay, well, um… This.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.01,0:19:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我应该 - 闭嘴 让我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I should…- Shut up. Just let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.21,0:20:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.13,0:20:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们是谁 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are these people? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.09,0:20:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁 - 我和他们不是一伙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - I'm not them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.69,0:20:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们给我发信息 我就按他们说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}They send me messages, and I do what they say.
