Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.49,0:29:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 他很享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he had a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.33,0:30:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦对了 安娜要举办个睡衣派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Anna's having a sleepover.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.65,0:30:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯西应该已经告诉你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cassie's probably already told you about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.09,0:30:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一间屋子里挤六个九岁的小屁孩儿 我一定是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six nine-year-olds in the house. I must be mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.29,0:30:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯尼你要去哪里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Kenny, where you heading back to?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.21,0:30:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 你刚说什么 - 你是回家还是去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. What? - Are you going home or…?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.65,0:30:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 额 - 培训 在伯明翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh… - Train. Birmingham.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.21,0:30:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,额 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.77,0:30:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 我住在伯明翰 - 哦 我丈夫是从伯明翰来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I-I live in Birmingham. - Oh, my husband's from Birmingham.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.89,0:30:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你住在哪个地区 - 南区\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What part are you? - South.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.49,0:30:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,南区\N{\fnArial\fs30}South.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.37,0:30:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大概 - 这样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mainly. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.93,0:30:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直住在那里吗 因为你口音好像不像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you always lived there? Cos you don't sound…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.61,0:30:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有口音 人人都这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have the accent, no. Everyone says that…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.81,0:30:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,说我没什么口音\N{\fnArial\fs30}That… I don't have the accent.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.21,0:30:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在那里长大 我小时候住在其他地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't grow up there though. I grew up somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.65,0:30:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如伦敦 我在伦敦长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like London. I grew up in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.73,0:30:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.49,0:30:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你父母是赫克托这边的还是佩妮那边的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And is your mum and dad on Hector's side or Penny's?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.53,0:31:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人过马路 他要过马路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone crossing! Crossing!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.53,0:31:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,实在抱歉 不能耽误他的火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about that! Can't miss his train.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.53,0:31:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,到我家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.21,0:31:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯尼 很高兴见到你 代我向佩妮问好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great to meet you, Kenny. Give my best to Penny, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.85,0:31:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 那么 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, of course. - Bye, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.49,0:31:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 凯伦 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye, Karen. - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.17,0:32:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会准时到的 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna make it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.13,0:32:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是这个路口\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's this junction.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.13,0:32:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啥 这个吗 - 是的 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? This one? - Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.65,0:32:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定这里就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure this is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.37,0:32:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,“打开蛋糕看看”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Look in the cake."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.13,0:32:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打开看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's look in the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.61,0:32:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开蛋糕看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look in the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.93,0:32:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,在蛋糕里面吧 我猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the cake, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.01,0:33:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.73,0:33:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是啥玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.77,0:33:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.93,0:33:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,“给你们五分钟时间考虑”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Five minutes to decide."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.85,0:33:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decide what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.37,0:33:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- “谁开车” - “谁去抢”\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Who is driver?" - "Who is robber?"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.25,0:34:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.21,0:34:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我 我 我们 不不不行 - 我来开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- W-w-we can't. We… - I'm driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.49,0:34:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你不能开车 我来开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you can't drive. I'm driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.17,0:34:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不熄火 在这里等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right here with the engine running.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.13,0:34:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们 不能这样做 我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We… We can't. We…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.93,0:34:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们还能怎么做 肯尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how else are we gonna deal with this, Kenny?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.21,0:34:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不会 - 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not… - Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.69,0:34:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不会 - 闭嘴安静听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not… - Shut up and listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.29,0:34:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有帽子和墨镜 没人会认出你来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hat and sunglasses. No one's going to ID you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.33,0:34:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你甚至可以是凯文·贝肯 这是第一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could be Kevin fucking Bacon. That's point one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.85,0:34:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静 第二 一般抢劫中 银行职员都是受过训练的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up! Point two, in a robbery, staff are trained.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.57,0:34:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.61,0:34:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们受训如何交出现金\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are trained to hand over the cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.29,0:34:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有争执 我看纪录片是这么拍的 没有反抗 看起来挺简单的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No argument. I saw it in a documentary. No resistance. It looked easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.05,0:34:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点都不简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.21,0:34:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道不简单 但我们还能做什么呢 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it isn't easy, but what the fuck else are we gonna do? Hey?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.09,0:34:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这个传出去了 我会失去我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This gets out, I will lose my kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.21,0:34:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 如果真发生了 我就去厨房\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I swear to God, I will stand in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.01,0:34:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿面包刀朝我脖子来一刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}and put a fucking bread knife through my throat if that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.61,0:34:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只是看看照片 - 然后在镜头前手淫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I only looked at pictures and… - And beat one off on camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.13,0:35:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他们掌控的把柄了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what they got, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.77,0:35:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那发红的小脸 脏不拉几的小手 四溅的精液\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hot little face, blurred fist, dick burping fucking spunk everywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.41,0:35:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈肯定会喜欢在脸书 推特还有in什么来着上面看见你那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mum's gonna love that on Facebook, Twitter, Insta-fucking-whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.65,0:35:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有她的朋友 所有人都能看到 你这样那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And her friends. All eyes on you, giving it that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.49,0:35:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,更别说上班时那些混蛋同事会叫你小精虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toss in the cunts at work, calling you Spurty McGoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.57,0:35:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘲笑你的高潮脸 把它当桌面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laughing at your come face, making it their desktop wallpaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.45,0:35:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不只接下来几周 几年可能都是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just weeks. We're talking years here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.37,0:35:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,上传到谷歌的图片就像吉普赛的诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pictures hang about on Google like a gypsy fucking curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.21,0:35:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,互联网不给人重来的机会 这事可没完\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no cure for the Internet. It would never go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.69,0:35:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事会一直跟着你 一生的污点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd be glued to your name, a fucking stain on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.37,0:35:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是我的话 我就去上吊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd hang myself if that was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.13,0:35:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一有机会我就扭断自己脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crack my fucking neck at the first opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.97,0:35:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是要钱 那就走进去然后抢钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just want the money, so go in there and do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.77,0:35:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会开走的 - 我不会开走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'll drive away. - I am not gonna drive away.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.53,0:35:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就坐在这里 发动机我都不关\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be sat here with the engine running.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.49,0:35:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不行 我不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.81,0:36:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可以的 可以的 - 我不行 我不行 不行不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can. You can. - I can't. I can't. I can't. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.89,0:36:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可以的 - 我不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can. - I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.25,0:36:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们时间不多了 肯尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have much time, Kenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.21,0:36:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不是真的 这不是真的 - 你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not real. This is not real. - You can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.73,0:36:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,振作起来 镇定点 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it together. Please hold it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.57,0:36:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 闭嘴 闭嘴 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up, shut up, shut up! Shut up! - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.45,0:36:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带了包么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you got a bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.09,0:36:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼睛 用鼻子呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glasses. Breathe through your nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.01,0:37:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me money.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.65,0:37:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧给我钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me money!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.97,0:37:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 好 - 很多 我需要很多钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. Okay. - Lots of it. I need lots of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.45,0:37:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我应该用你的包么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sh-should I use your bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.01,0:37:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.69,0:38:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在把包还给你 这样可以么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to pass this back to you now. Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.45,0:38:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,站在那里打电话的一个伙计吓到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was some bloke standing there on his phone freaking me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.97,0:38:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你拿到了吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you get it? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.05,0:38:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,开快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.53,0:38:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,限速40 你想因为超速被拦下来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speed limit's 40. Wanna get stopped for speeding now?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.13,0:39:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 天哪 - 妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, shit. - Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.69,0:39:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有警笛声\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a siren.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.05,0:39:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘 小声点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh! Shush.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.29,0:39:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go! - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.81,0:39:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.65,0:39:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.05,0:39:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.81,0:39:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.45,0:40:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.33,0:40:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该给他们发短信 是吧 告诉他们我们拿到钱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should text them, no? Tell them we got the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.65,0:40:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们说我们要拿着钱去某个地方 - 什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They say we got to take it somewhere. - Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.05,0:40:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.37,0:40:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.61,0:40:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好嘞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.08,0:40:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,“最后的指令”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Final instruction."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.21,0:41:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,“把车开走然后销毁”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Take car away and destroy."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.09,0:41:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroy the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.13,0:41:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,“就你一个人去”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Just you alone."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.37,0:41:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么只是你一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why just you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.09,0:41:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得把钱拿去那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to take the money somewhere over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.37,0:41:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 为什么总是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Why have I got to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.57,0:41:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.97,0:41:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.41,0:41:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好赶紧去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better go, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.45,0:41:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你都走到这一步了 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you got this far, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.65,0:41:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,把包扔在那里就好了 就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just drop it off. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.45,0:41:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.29,0:42:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 听着 肯尼 听着 我很抱歉 刚刚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, listen, Kenny. Look. I'm sorry about… just back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.41,0:42:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,吵你大声嚷嚷 骂了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouting at you. Calling you stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.25,0:42:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这人很正常的 我发誓 当一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an all right bloke really. I swear I am, when it's…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.73,0:42:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,当一切比较正常的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When stuff's normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.85,0:42:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己当心 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take care, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.54,0:44:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯嗯 等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. Hang on, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.17,0:44:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他告诉我要先启动这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told me I had to set this thing off first.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.61,0:45:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.45,0:45:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得到奖金了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the prize money?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.89,0:45:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奖金 - 就是那个 打架那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Prize money? - You know, for the… fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.37,0:45:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is there a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.93,0:45:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们没跟你说吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They didn't tell you? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.21,0:45:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得打一架\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to fight…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.61,0:45:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然的话他们会把手里的把柄全都发到网上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or else they post everything they've got on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.69,0:45:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜者得到钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winner takes the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.21,0:45:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,打架在所难免了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.01,0:45:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.05,0:45:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在看着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.41,0:45:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的架 我们怎么知道何时结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}What sort of fight? How do we know when it's over?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.25,0:45:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们 我们怎么判断输赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How… How do we know who's won?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.13,0:46:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你什么情况 但我如果这个泄露出去我的人生就完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know about you, but my life's over if this gets out.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.73,0:46:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,真他妈完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking over.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.61,0:46:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们手上有你什么把柄\N{\fnArial\fs30}What they get you for?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.13,0:46:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是看了几张照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just looked at some photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.97,0:46:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样了 我只是看了一两张照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all. I just looked at one or two photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.65,0:46:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.05,0:46:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是是 我也只是看了照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, I just looked at pictures too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.85,0:46:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,照片里面的她们几岁啊 有多小\N{\fnArial\fs30}How young were they? In the pictures?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.77,0:46:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多小\N{\fnArial\fs30}How young?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.61,0:46:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.25,0:46:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.89,0:47:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 朋友 别 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, mate. Don't. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.61,0:47:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.49,0:47:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.37,0:48:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,深呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.89,0:48:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,明迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mindy?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.45,0:49:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经沦落到这种地步了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you've become?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.77,0:49:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 肮脏恶心的变态 - 嘿 放轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A dirty, sick, disgusting pervert? - Hey, relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.97,0:49:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我 你是这种人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me! Is that what you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.25,0:50:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯尼 你做了什么啊 他们说那还是孩子啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do, Kenny? They're saying it's kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.29,0:50:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是小孩子的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you've been looking at kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.49,0:50:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,林德赛看见了 网上有你的视频\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Lindsey saw it. There's a video of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.93,0:50:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她所有的朋友都看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of her friends have got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.53,0:50:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子啊 肯尼 告诉我这不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids, Kenny! Tell me that's not true!
